{{!-- The fold caret on its own, for sections with no edit pencil to sit beside.
      Rendered INSIDE the heading (which becomes its positioning context), unlike
      the pencil-bearing sections where section-edit-toggle emits it into the
      section's top-right corner — either way the sheet finds the heading from the
      caret and folds the run of content below it. Caller passes `collapse`, the id
      the fold is remembered under. --}}
<a class="stonetop-section-collapse" data-section="{{collapse}}" role="button" tabindex="0"
   aria-expanded="true" title="Collapse section"><i class="fas fa-caret-down"></i></a>
